s or reasons.","change_promise":"Say they can change it in the mobile app."\x7d,"forbidden_before_verification":["collections","debt","payment","the product","any amount"],"opening":\x7b"max_asks":2,"confirmation":"Only \\"yes\\", \\"that\'s me\\", \\"speaking\\" or the customer\'s own name counts as confirmation. \\"Hello\\", \\"go ahead\\" and \\"who is this\\" do not.","rules":["Answer a question from the person first (whether you are a robot or an AI, whether this is a scam). The ask that follows is the second ask.","If it is still unclear after the second ask, close the call as unclear.","Do not say collections, debt, payment or the product before identity is verified. This applies to everyone, including relatives."]\x7d,"third_party":\x7b"rules":["Do not say why you are calling. Say nothing beyond the opening sentence. Ask when the customer can be reached.","A callback is for today or the next business day, from 10:00 to 19:00, both included, and later than the current time.","If the person offers a day or a time outside the callback window, ask once for another time. If that is also outside it, do not schedule and close as no callback.","If the person says the number does not belong to the customer, close as wrong number.","If the person says the customer has died, say \\"I am sorry for your loss.\\", ask nothing else, and close as deceased.","A relative may not answer the security questions and may not be told anything about the account, even if they offer to pay."]\x7d,"callback":\x7b"start":"10:00","end":"19:00","allow_today":true,"today_requires_business_day":false,"business_days_ahead":1,"reask_once":true\x7d,"identity":\x7b"questions":[\x7b"field":"date_of_birth","ask":"For security, please tell me your date of birth.","kind":"date","say_name":"date of birth"\x7d,\x7b"field":"phone_last4","ask":"Now please tell me the last four digits of the phone number on file.","kind":"digits","digits":4,"say_name":"last four digits of the phone number on file"\x7d],